"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":1682418586,"text":"うーん、これならそれほど難しくないはずだ…","nextNodeIds":[715230102]},{"nodeId":715230102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3938533570,"text":"何をしてるの？","nextNodeIds":[715230103]},{"nodeId":715230103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":624054610,"text":"ゲームの準備係なんだ…「百発百中の投壺」を聞いたことはあるかい？","nextNodeIds":[715230104]},{"nodeId":715230104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1350923970,"text":"すべての壺が命中するように投げるの？","nextNodeIds":[715230105]},{"nodeId":715230105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":1707238098,"text":"おお！ほとんど正解だ、このゲームの真髄はまさに「投げる」こと。だが「壺」を投げるわけではない。","nextNodeIds":[715230106]},{"nodeId":715230106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":488054482,"text":"これの遊び方は私も古い本で読んだのだ、簡単に紹介しよう…","nextNodeIds":[715230107]},{"nodeId":715230107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":3148603362,"text":"最も伝統的なルールによれば、この「投壺」というゲームは全ての参加者が静かに座っていなければならない。","nextNodeIds":[715230108]},{"nodeId":715230108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":2545686874,"text":"えっと、静かに座ってさらに特殊な姿勢を保たなければならない——ここでは紹介を割愛するよ、座布団がないからね…","nextNodeIds":[715230109]},{"nodeId":715230109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":3253946306,"text":"静かに座ったら、プレイヤーは特定の音楽のリズムに合わせ、持っている「投矢」を遠くの「壺」に向かって投げる。","nextNodeIds":[715230110]},{"nodeId":715230110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":3312642130,"text":"「投矢」の入れ方、すなわち「役」にも、それぞれ特別な名前がついている。","nextNodeIds":[715230111]},{"nodeId":715230111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":216302714,"text":"最初に壺に入った矢は「有初」と呼ばれ、二本目の矢も入れば「連中」という。","nextNodeIds":[715230112]},{"nodeId":715230112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":2599678162,"text":"投げた矢が壺の耳に当たれば「貫耳」。壺に入った矢が跳ね返ってくれば「驍箭」…","nextNodeIds":[715230113,715230116]},{"nodeId":715230113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3266299266,"text":"ふ、複雑すぎる！","nextNodeIds":[715230114]},{"nodeId":715230114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":3654923418,"text":"ご心配なく。言っただろう、これは「最も伝統的なルール」にすぎない。","nextNodeIds":[715230115]},{"nodeId":715230115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":1601960122,"text":"皆に遊んでもらいやすくするため、ルールをかなり簡略化した。","nextNodeIds":[715230118]},{"nodeId":715230118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":2798291546,"text":"コホン、とにかく、一定時間内に「投矢」をたくさん壺に入れればいい、あとは…私に任せろ！","nextNodeIds":[715230119]},{"nodeId":715230119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3509291410,"text":"ルールがかなり簡単になったね！","nextNodeIds":[715230120]},{"nodeId":715230120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":2582191594,"text":"ああ…その本にあったルールでも、壺に入った矢が多い人が勝ちと書いてあった。","nextNodeIds":[715230121]},{"nodeId":715230121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":2943689818,"text":"負けたら酒を飲んで詩を作れとかは…私はやりたくないな、気まずくなりそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[715230122]},{"nodeId":715230122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":3673670538,"text":"とにかく！会場準備はほぼできたし、「壺」はあっちだ。「投矢」もすぐに持ってこよう。","nextNodeIds":[715230123]},{"nodeId":715230123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":860097242,"text":"興味があるなら、プレイしてみるといい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715230116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2594558746,"text":"お、覚えられない！","nextNodeIds":[715230117]},{"nodeId":715230117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","textMapHash":1595044786,"text":"ご心配なく。こんなに名前を覚える必要はない。これは、その…私が覚えるべきものだ。","nextNodeIds":[715230118]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7152301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30426"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7152301],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30426,"speakerName":"廷稚","count":18},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":5}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171523],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":306613574,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/V4.1PoetryActivity/Q7152301","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":0,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":715230101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","ILHDNJDDEOP":7152301,"JGFEJPBPHGJ":[],"JNFAMBOFGHJ":false,"KINCAGMDMHH":[30426],"KJLNGKKBBOI":"TALK_MARK_NONE","KNBDEPPFNBN":0,"LCIDOOMOIPM":0,"LIJPPLJCHGI":0,"LMAPLNHKPOH":[],"MBDOOOMPFCD":false,"MEGMNOELHAO":false,"MMCFFPNN